{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":65007,\"title\":\"Nowhere to Hide\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Steven Rambam is a private investigator who has pursued suspects all over the world. He has conducted or coordinated foreign insurance-related probes, including those of hundreds of deaths, and a significant number have resulted in confessions, arrests and prosecutions. In \\\"Nowhere to Hide,\\\" Rambam recounts the most dramatic cases from his extensive file -- just when criminals think they have it made, the world-renowned PI finds them and brings them to justice. Each hourlong story interweaves exclusive undercover surveillance clips with the exotic adventures, before concluding with the captures.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kC9emgfNzP4oi9gE9dfOTc9pClV.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/TTfdfyk5jLY/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Crime\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":12,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Investigation Discovery\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2015-09-24\",\"cast\":[],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"TTfdfyk5jLY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"RZDZVDT-7PY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"P7_G2JxhGOM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":245312,\"title\":\"A Man on the Inside\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c09XdTLpLku2tqHt158NZBgC4hi.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2230769230769231,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":243951,\"title\":\"Dengler\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4K2odL6lpFe3Rmot2NMuiXxwWMv.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2219512